              "text": "FIELD RESEARCH"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\nMore than six years in South India (mainly Tamil Nadu); fourteen months in North India (mainly Uttar Pradesh); fifteen months in Pakistan (mainly Panjab); eleven months in Tajikistan. Brief field visits to Kyrgyzstan, Uzbekistan, China (Xinjiang), Iran (Isfahan, Tehran, Qazvin), and Ghana (Ashanti region)."
            }
          ]
        },
